#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/sdr_backend.py:7
msgid "SDR 硬件后端抽象层。"
msgstr "SDR hardware backend abstraction layer."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/sdr_backend.py:9
msgid ""
"定义与具体 SDR 硬件无关的统一接口, 支持 UHD (USRP), pyadi-iio (PlutoSDR/ANTSDR), Mock "
"(无硬件仿真) 三种后端。所有后端实现 SDRDevice 接口后即可接入 SLETransceiver。"
msgstr ""
"Defines a hardware-agnostic unified interface supporting three backends: UHD"
" (USRP), pyadi-iio (PlutoSDR/ANTSDR), and Mock (no-hardware simulation). Any"
" backend implementing the SDRDevice interface integrates with "
"SLETransceiver."

